<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5354" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνεῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of
				lamb,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. χλαῖνα</span>
			<i>lambskin</i> cloak, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.62
			</span></i>:— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμναῖος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				97.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνειός</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμνιος</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτών, ὑμήν</span>), ὁ, <i>inner membrane</i> surrounding the foetus, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.58
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				15.4
			</span></i>: also in neut. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνεῖον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμνίον.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
